--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project includes branding and visual assets originally from OpenAI's
Sora platform, retained for historical preservation and visual continuity
for users browsing their personal archives. These assets are NOT licensed
under the MIT license above — all rights to them remain with their
respective owners (OpenAI). They are used in good faith and for personal,
non-commercial archival viewing.

Affected files:

  static/favicon.ico                  Sora favicon
  static/sora-cloud.svg               Sora cloud mascot, used in the theme toggle
  static/sora-icon.webp               Sora app icon
  static/sora-icon-transparent.webp   Sora app icon (transparent variant)

If you are a rights holder for any of these assets and would prefer they be
removed or replaced with neutral equivalents, please open a GitHub issue
on this repository and we will swap them promptly.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by OpenAI.
"Sora" is a trademark of OpenAI.

Note on static/sora-stars.png: the starfield background used by the Sora
theme is an AI-generated image created for this project to evoke the look
of Sora's post-shutdown mobile UI. It is NOT an OpenAI asset; it is
distributed under the MIT license above with the rest of the project.


