OPEN-SOURCE DEPENDENCIES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sora View Lite depends on a number of open-source packages distributed under
their own licenses. See package.json for the complete list and node_modules/
for each package's bundled LICENSE file after npm install. Notable runtime
dependencies include:

  SvelteKit                Sebastian Stege & contributors        MIT
  better-sqlite3           Joshua Wise                           MIT
  DuckDB / @duckdb/node-api  DuckDB Foundation                   MIT
  Playwright (optional)    Microsoft                             Apache-2.0
  qrcode                   Ryan Day                              MIT

The build tooling (Vite, Rollup, esbuild, etc.) is similarly MIT / Apache-2.0
licensed. See node_modules/<package>/LICENSE for the canonical text.
